{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26103","headline":"织妇词 · 鲍溶","name":"织妇词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百日织彩丝，一朝停杼机。\n机中有双凤，化作天边衣。\n使人马如风，诚不阻音徽。\n影响随羽翼，双双绕君飞。\n行人岂愿行，不怨不知归。\n所怨天尽处，何人见光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}